Subject: [PATCH 08/33] WIP mmb: Q3_K (WTYPE 9) and IQ3_XXS (WTYPE 10)

- mmb_dq_row_q3k: 110-byte block (hmask/qs/scales/2-bit fields)
- mmb_dq_row_iq3xxs: 98-byte block (256-entry grid + ksigns + gas word)
- Q3_K enabled dense+routed+GLU
- IQ3_XXS: routed enabled, fused GLU default-off (measured net loss; env
  GGML_CUDA_MMB_IQ3XXS=1 opts in)
- UD-Q3_K_M: pp2048 2092->2295 (+9.7%), pp8192 1942->2120 (+9.2%)
